# OpenSSH Server Configuration for Homelab Executor Container
Port 22
Protocol 2

# Security & Access Control
PermitRootLogin no
AllowUsers executor
PasswordAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
AuthorizedKeysFile /home/executor/.ssh/authorized_keys
StrictModes yes

# Process & Runtime
PidFile /run/sshd.pid
UsePAM no
X11Forwarding no
PrintMotd no
AcceptEnv LANG LC_*

# Subsystems
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
